WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.540
Episode 10

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.540
Goodbye Solar System<i>!!
</i>From the Galactic System with Love<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.540
( Air date: Dec 8, 1974 )

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.550
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.350
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:40.500
...it's the space battleship Yamato.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.200
Space Battleship

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.200
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:43.950
It's about to take off to Iscandar...

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:48.360
...carrying the fate of humanity.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:54.750
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:55.250 --> 00:01:03.550
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:10.350
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:17.050
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:49.410
In the year 2199...

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:54.900
...Earth was about to be destroyed, due to attacks from the mysterious planet, Gamilus.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.310
Radioactive poison was going to end
all life on Earth in just one year.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:05.640
Planet Iscandar

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:06.540
Meanwhile, Queen Starsha of planet
Iscandar, a twin of planet Gamilus...

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:08.600
...who wished for peace and
happiness in space...

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:14.370
...sent a message to Earth offering a
radioactive purifier, the Cosmo Cleaner.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:21.000
{ZEN}The last spaceship of Earth,
the space battleship Yamato...

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.690
{ZEN}...took off for Iscandar,
carrying the hopes of mankind.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:02.810
Eluding the pursuit of this evil enemy,
and destroying the Gamilus base on Pluto...

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:08.380
{IMAYA}...the Yamato is now leaving our Solar System,
and heading for the great sea of stars.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:14.250
Yamato, Yamato, this is the
Earth Defense Command Center.

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.330
We have an
emergency message.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.460
Captain Okita, please respond.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:21.950
This is Yamato. We copy you.
Adjusting to cycle 003.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:28.540
Captain Okita, Captain Okita, an emergency
message from Earth. Please come down.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.850
Maintain that cycle, please.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.550
We're too far, and it's
hard to match the frequency.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:38.050
Maximum time is five minutes
each, and probably no more.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.340
Put it on
the main screen.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:47.760
Okita, you've gone a long way.
How is the Yamato ?

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:47.900
Earth Defense Force Command Center

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.010
The Yamato is intact...

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.750
...but Commander, this will
be our last transmission...

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.250
...after which we won't
be able to communicate.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.720
That's why I wanted to
tell you about Earth.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:04.560
Earth is in despair,
and you are our last hope.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.210
Take a look at this.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:14.750
There's no life
left on the surface...

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:20.530
...and the contamination is reaching the
underground cities, and some are panicking.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:27.280
{TAEZU}People are scared, and they
continuously visit us for help.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:35.280
{SHIKASHI}As the Yamato went further and further,
people started feeling more nervous.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:38.350
{HITOBITO}All they talk about is the possibility
of the Yamato's return...

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:41.510
{HITOBITO}...and they start losing hope,
because of its impossible mission.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:45.550
Okita, we want to know more about the
Yamato...everything about the Yamato...

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.110
Please give me five minutes
to adjust the power.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.660
The Yamato will return.
Definitely.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:58.320
That's right.  Tell your families
about it in your own words.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.660
Tell them yourself.

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.040
We've already left
our Solar System...

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.400
...and we're in a part of the Galaxy
we've never been in before.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.450
{SOREWA}Without question,
it's due to your service.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:17.150
{SHIKASHI}Please keep in mind that
our 148,000 light year mission...

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:21.770
{SHIKASHI}...is to obtain the Cosmo
Cleaner from planet Iscandar.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:27.620
{SONO}Come to think of it, our
journey hasn't even started yet.

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:25.790
Galactic System

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:33.000
{WAREWARE}We must hurry.  Fortunately,
there's no sign of the enemy lately.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:32.700
Large Magellanic Cloud

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.860
{KONO}We'll recover the lost time, in this
peaceful moment. We'll warp, a long warp.

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.000
Hey, long warp, he said...

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:47.580
If we do, we'll be where we won't even be able
to identify Earth, or even the Solar System.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:51.410
{YOTTE}Today, I'll allow each crew member to have
five minutes of communication with Earth.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:56.930
Alright, let's show them
we're doing well.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:58.160
I can encourage my family.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.230
Thank you.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:04.700
Let's say goodbye to Earth and its sister
planets one by one. Have fun at the party.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.460
Should I shave ?

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.290
No, you don't need to.

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.970
What should I say ?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.900
Look guys, this is my baby,
born just before the launch.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.290
Let's see.
Oh, cute.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.620
He must be a lot
bigger by now.

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.110
It's ready.
First person, please go in.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.230
Okay, I'm going.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:42.360
Mr. Kodai, you look depressed.
May I analyze you ?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.080
It's nothing.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.700
Mr. Shima, go ahead.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.900
Hey, Jiro.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.660
Jiro, over here.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:51.590
Brother.

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:56.400
Dad, Mom, it's Big
Brother Daisuke. Big Brother.

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:59.110
What's wrong, Jiro ?
Are you crying ? How are you ?

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.340
Daisuke.

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:03.430
It's been a while.
Father, you lost weight ?

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.860
Do I look
like I have ?

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.770
Jiro, what're you making ?

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.160
The Yamato.
It's a mini Yamato, though...

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:15.600
Jiro is cheering his friends up with the mini
Yamato, because he's too little to be a pilot.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:20.560
Brother, three of my friends are ill
because of the poison from the surface.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:26.810
So I showed them this Yamato, and told
them that it will bring the Cosmo Cleaner.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.650
Don't worry. I'm sure...

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:34.930
Well, then, Father,
Mother, take care.

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:35.940
Brother.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:39.350
Jiro, be a good boy.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.650
Goodbye.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.670
My turn is soon.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.470
How was it, Mr. Shima ?

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:53.990
My younger brother's grown up,
and he encouraged me.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.240
Your little brother did ?

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.880
Now it's your turn to be
encouraged by your grandkids.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:02.110
Yeah, thanks.

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:29.000
Mr. Kodai, what're you doing ?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:33.030
You'd better go to the
communication room.  Mr. Kodai ?

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.280
Don't bother me.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.840
You're gonna cry when
you see your mom.

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:47.520
What about you ?
I wonder.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.090
Hey, why did you
leave your posts ?

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:52.500
Well, to communicate with Earth.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:54.380
What about the
personnel for a scramble ?

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.680
There's no one.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.180
Go back to your posts.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:02.240
Emergency personnel shouldn't leave
their posts.  Go back, immediately.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.230
How could they
be so lackadaisical ?

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:22.080
Captain.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:26.150
Captain, is there anything
I can help you with ?

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:29.450
If so,
I'll visit you myself.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:30.950
No, it's nothing.

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:36.230
Hey, it was the Captain.
What happened ?

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:39.420
He didn't have to come down here.
I was surprised.

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:49.840
Kodai isn't here.
Where did he go ?

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:52.600
Oh, the Chief has
gone to the hangar.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.210
That's a problem.
It's his turn.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.360
I'll go and tell him.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.740
Thanks.

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:07.910
Kato, what're you looking for ?

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:09.150
Chief...?!

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:13.360
Chief, this is causing Mori problems.
Please, hurry and come with me.

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.400
The mechanics will
take care of maintenance.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:22.430
Kato, did you finish
your transmission ?

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:23.630
No.

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:25.410
Then, hurry and get it done.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.650
I'm getting nervous.

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:35.930
Miss Mori...

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.650
The Chief seems to be declining
to make a communication.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:41.810
Declining ?

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:53.750
Captain, you're causing me problems.
You can't be in the kitchen with that uniform.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.400
Cleanliness is the
first priority here.

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.620
Oh, sorry.
Pardon me.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.080
Kodai, what're you doing ?

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.010
Checking around the ship.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.600
This place is done.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:20.610
Oh, the vase is in the wrong place.
The scroll is tilted, and the window is dirty.

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:22.600
Shokichi, is Aiko doing well ?

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.260
Yes, Father.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.690
Kikuko, is she behaving well ?

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:27.430
Yes, ah...

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.190
You can't spoil her, you know ?

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.510
Grandpa, you're loud.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:33.700
Aiko !

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:38.590
Aiko, you're getting bigger.

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:57.850
I guess I have no
place to go today.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:00.200
But Kodai is also...

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:22.490
Shokichi, don't lose hope.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:24.500
Even if you think it's over,
if you lose hope for the future...

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.150
...your life will be
even more miserable.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:29.150
Raise Aiko well.
Aiko, grow up.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:37.490
Wait, I want to talk more !
I have many more things to say !

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:56.410
I wonder what happened to Mr. Tokugawa.
His time has already expired.

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.810
I'm sorry.
I was confused.

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:06.150
Mr. Tokugawa.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:11.050
Can you stay with me,
if you don't mind ?

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.860
It's my turn,
but I'm nervous.

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:21.880
Mom, what's going on ?

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.900
I heard that we don't
have much time, so...

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:28.240
It's a picture of one
of the grooms to be.

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.740
Groom ?

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.150
Why not ?

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:37.150
When you return, it wouldn't
be too early to get married.

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.870
I have eight
candidates already.

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:43.560
Your mom is desperate to
find your perfect match.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:48.350
I like this person most. He's an
engineer of the undersea city...

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:52.210
Mom, please don't. I don't want to
say goodbye with a talk like this.

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:55.680
Goodbye ?  But you'll come
home in one year, right ?

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.050
That's true, but...

00:14:57.050 --> 00:15:00.480
Did you find someone you
like on the Yamato ?

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:02.410
No, that's...

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.250
Should I leave ?

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.300
Oh, Mr. Tokugawa,
you're so mean.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.310
Don't say it's
that elderly person.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:14.510
He should be young, so that
you can have many kids together.

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:18.950
Sorry, Mr. Tokugawa.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:22.890
Mom, please change the subject.
Earth is in trouble, right ?

00:15:22.890 --> 00:15:26.010
That's why...that's why
we need many children.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:32.700
Only your generation and
your children can save Earth.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.500
Your father
and I believe so.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.500
We want to.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:46.330
No. You must come home alive, otherwise I wouldn't have let you go so far away in space.

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:48.960
I'll return for sure.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:49.880
You're lying.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.010
Mom.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:56.850
I'm looking forward to seeing the
stack of pictures you pile up, Mom.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.120
Well, bye, Yuki...

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.120
Bye...

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.320
Bye, Dad, Mom.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:03.510
Take care.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.500
Dad, Mom...

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:18.700
I'm sorry.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.650
I thought I'd be able
to cheer you up, but...

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:25.060
Mom is always
like that.  But, sorry...

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.910
Parents are just about
the same everywhere.

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:30.810
My son was born.
My son.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:31.970
Really ?

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:35.160
Listen, my wife volunteered
to be a soldier.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.710
We've got to get the
Cosmo Cleaner and go home.

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:43.500
Space is big...

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.620
...and it's endless.

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.610
There's no sake.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:17:01.590
I didn't find any souvenirs
for you on Jupiter or Pluto.

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:11.920
Mee, farewell.

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:23.110
That's right.
I have someplace to go to.

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:29.810
That's the only place of
relief for the Captain and I.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:35.260
Kodai, you're here.  Everyone has
finished their communications.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:37.980
Sorry, but I have
a place to go.

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:39.200
You shouldn't.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:41.900
Communications with Earth are
getting worse as time passes.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.910
I want you to finish
as soon as possible.

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:46.520
I see.

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:03.150
Oh, no.  I didn't tell
him how to use it.

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.010
Kodai...

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.240
Has it malfunctioned ?

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:20.080
Why isn't he talking
to his family...?

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:25.750
I'm sorry.

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:41.380
Kodai, what're you doing ?
Come see me.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.500
Nobody understands.
No one can.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.150
You've finally come, Kodai.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.260
I wanted to see you.

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:23.350
Both of us are a
nuisance wherever we go.

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.240
How about this ?
Have a drink ?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.770
Don't just stand there,
have a seat.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:32.890
Okay.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.620
Here.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:36.420
Thank you.

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:44.550
Thank you.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:54.040
Captain, one more.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:56.190
That's more like it.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:30.910
Kodai.

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:33.010
Yes ?

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:40.560
I'm going to say goodbye
to my homeland.

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:47.370
Goodbye !

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:48.660
Captain...?!

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:52.050
Kodai, you say goodbye, too.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:52.910
Yes, sir.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:21:01.100
Goodbye !
We will return, so stay alive !

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:02.140
Goodbye !

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:04.200
Goodbye !

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:07.440
Goodbye...{echo}

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:38.610
We'll surely return,
we told the red scarf.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:47.100
So greet us on that day.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:55.530
We're in distant space now.

00:21:55.530 --> 00:22:04.000
We dream among the stars.

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:12.500
In the eyes of the travelers...

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:19.810
...we wish to envision romance in them.

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:23.960
La, la, la, la, la, la.

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:28.150
La, la, la, la, la, la.

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:36.900
La, la, la, red scarf...

00:22:40.560 --> 00:22:43.580
We're finally out of
visual contact range.

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:45.850
We can no longer
receive video transmissions.

00:22:49.820 --> 00:22:52.290
The party is over.

00:22:56.080 --> 00:23:00.120
Yamato... You dare to
step out into the galaxy.

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:03.560
Come to me.

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:11.360
Lord Desler

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:07.320
I can imagine you being frightened
by the vastness of space...

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:11.080
...and the great power
of Gamilus which rules it.

00:23:13.360 --> 00:23:18.700
The Yamato continues its journey after
leaving our home, the Solar System.

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:22.160
Only the evil hands
of Gamilus awaits them.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:27.480
The Yamato has unexpectedly
used 50 days already.

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:31.300
Mankind will be
extinct in 315 days.

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:36.200
315 days till the destruction of Earth

